# CODE-LEVEL READINESS AUDIT

## Complete API Call Analysis

---

# nexus_install

## API Calls

| Task | Endpoint | Until | Retries | Delay | Failed_when | Ignore |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Binary \| Wait for Nexus API | /service/rest/v1/status | ✅ YES | 30 | 10s | NO | NO |

**Analysis:** This is the PRIMARY readiness gate. Retries 30 times × 10s delay = 300s max wait.

**Transient failure behavior:** 500/503/404 will be retried. 409 will be retried.

**Execution path:** nexus_deploy.yml → nexus_install → install_binary.yml → Wait for Nexus API

---

