# nexus_blobstores

## API Calls

| Task | Endpoint | Until | Retries | Delay | Failed_when | Ignore |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Get existing blob stores | {{ nexus_blobstores_list_url }} | ✅ YES | {{ nexus_api_retries }} | {{ nexus_api_retry_delay }} | NO | NO |
