# SUMMARY

## API Calls Protected by Retry

| Role | Task | Retries | Delay | Total Wait |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| nexus_install | Wait for Nexus API | 30 | 10s | 300s |
| nexus_config | Ensure Nexus is running | 10 | 5s | 50s |
| nexus_blobstores | Get existing blob stores | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_blobstores | Create file blob stores | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_blobstores | Create S3 blob stores | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_blobstores | Verify blobstore creation | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos | Get existing repositories | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos | Create repositories | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos | Update repositories | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos | Delete unmanaged | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos_groups | Get existing groups | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos_groups | Create groups | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos_groups | Update groups | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_repos_groups | Delete unmanaged | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_cleanup | Get existing policies | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_cleanup | Create policies | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_cleanup | Update policies | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_cleanup | Delete unmanaged | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_security | Configure anonymous access | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_security | Enable security realms | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_security | Enable SSL Only mode | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_proxy | Configure outbound proxy | 3 | 5s | 15s |
| nexus_restore | Wait for Nexus API | 30 | 10s | 300s |
| nexus_upgrade | Wait for Nexus API | 30 | 10s | 300s |

## API Calls NOT Protected by Retry

None — all API calls have retry logic.

## Startup Race Conditions

| Race Condition | Likelihood | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| OrientDB not ready when API returns 200 | LOW | nexus_install waits 300s, nexus_config adds 50s |
| Repository indices still loading | LOW | API returns 200 only when ready |
| Blobstores before internal services | LOW | Retry logic handles this |
| Realms not initialized | LOW | Security has retry logic |

## Readiness Verification

| Role | Has Own Wait | Relies On |
|---|---|---|
| nexus_install | ✅ YES (300s) | None |
| nexus_config | ✅ YES (50s) | nexus_install |
| nexus_blobstores | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |
| nexus_repos | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |
| nexus_repos_groups | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |
| nexus_cleanup | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |
| nexus_security | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |
| nexus_proxy | ❌ NO | nexus_install + nexus_config |

## Verdict

| Category | Status |
|---|---|
| API calls protected by retry | ✅ 100% |
| API calls NOT protected | ✅ 0% |
| Startup race conditions | ⚠️ LOW RISK |
| Downstream protection | ✅ ADEQUATE |

**All API calls are protected by retry logic. No unprotected REST API calls found.**

**Audit complete. No code modified.**
